{"book":"mormon","heading":{"en":"The Nephites gather to the land of Cumorah for the final battles—Mormon hides the sacred records in the hill Cumorah—The Lamanites are victorious, and the Nephite nation is destroyed—Hundreds of thousands are slain with the sword. About A.D. 385.","sm":"Ua faapotopoto faatasi sa Nifaē i le laueleele o Kumora mo le taua faaiu—Ua natia e Mamona talafaamaumau paia i le Mauga o Kumora—Ua manumalo sa Lamanā, ma ua faaumatia le malo o sa Nifaē—Ua fasiotia selau o afe i le pelu. E tusa o le 385 T.A.","words":[{"en":"·","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"·","sm":"faapotopoto"},{"en":"·","sm":"faatasi"},{"en":"·","sm":"sa"},{"en":"The Nephites gather","sm":"Nifaē"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"·","sm":"laueleele"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"to the land of Cumorah","sm":"Kumora"},{"en":"·","sm":"mo"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"·","sm":"taua"},{"en":"for the final battles—","sm":"faaiu—"},{"en":"·","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"·","sm":"natia"},{"en":"·","sm":"e"},{"en":"Mormon hides","sm":"Mamona"},{"en":"·","sm":"talafaamaumau"},{"en":"the sacred records","sm":"paia"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"·","sm":"Mauga"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"in the hill Cumorah—","sm":"Kumora—"},{"en":"·","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"·","sm":"manumalo"},{"en":"·","sm":"sa"},{"en":"The Lamanites are victorious,","sm":"Lamanā,"},{"en":"·","sm":"ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"ua"},{"en":"and is destroyed","sm":"faaumatia"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"·","sm":"malo"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"·","sm":"sa"},{"en":"the Nephite nation—","sm":"Nifaē—"},{"en":"·","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"·","sm":"fasiotia"},{"en":"·","sm":"selau"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"Hundreds of thousands are slain","sm":"afe"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"with the sword.","sm":"pelu."},{"en":"·","sm":"E"},{"en":"·","sm":"tusa"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"about","sm":"le"},{"en":"385","sm":"385"},{"en":"A.D.","sm":"T.A."}]},"num":6,"verses":[{"en":"And now I finish my record concerning the des