"}]},{"en":"And it came to pass that we did march forth to the land of Cumorah, and we did pitch our tents around about the hill Cumorah; and it was in a land of many waters, rivers, and fountains; and  here we had hope to gain advantage over the Lamanites.","n":4,"sm":"Ma sa oo ina matou savavali atu i le laueleele o Kumora, ma sa matou faatutu o matou faleie faataamilo i le mauga o Kumora; ma o se laueleele sa tele ai vai, o vaitafe, ma vaipuna; ma o iinei na matou faamoemoe o le a matou maua ai se lelei sili atu i luga o sa Lamanā.","w":[{"en":"·","sm":"Ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"sa"},{"en":"·","sm":"oo"},{"en":"And it came to pass that","sm":"ina"},{"en":"·","sm":"matou"},{"en":"·","sm":"savavali"},{"en":"we did march forth","sm":"atu"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"unto the land","sm":"laueleele"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"of Cumorah,","sm":"Kumora,"},{"en":"·","sm":"ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"sa"},{"en":"·","sm":"matou"},{"en":"and we did pitch","sm":"faatutu"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"·","sm":"matou"},{"en":"our tents","sm":"faleie"},{"en":"round about","sm":"faataamilo"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"the hill","sm":"mauga"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"of Cumorah;","sm":"Kumora;"},{"en":"and","sm":"ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"·","sm":"se"},{"en":"it was a land","sm":"laueleele"},{"en":"·","sm":"sa"},{"en":"·","sm":"tele"},{"en":"·","sm":"ai"},{"en":"wherein were many waters,","sm":"vai,"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"rivers,","sm":"vaitafe,"},{"en":"·","sm":"ma"},{"en":"and fountains;","sm":"vaipuna;"},{"en":"and","sm":"ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"here","sm":"iinei"},{"en":"·","sm":"na"},{"en":"·","sm":"matou"},{"en":"we did hope","sm":"faamoemoe"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"·","sm":"a"},{"en":"·","sm":"matou"},{"en":"·","sm":"maua"},{"en":"we should gain","sm":"ai"},{"en":"·","sm":"se"},{"en":"·","sm":"lelei"},{"en":"·","sm":"sili"},{"en":"an advantage","sm":"atu"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"over","sm":"luga"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"·","sm":"sa"},{"en":"the Lamanites.","sm":"Lamanā."}]},{"en":"And when three hundred and eighty and four years had passed away, we had gathered in all the remainder of our people unto the land of Cumorah.","n":5,"sm":"Ma e mavae atu le toluselau valusefulu ma le fa o tausaga ua matou faapotopotoina faatasi o matou tagata uma na totoe i le laueleele o Kumora.","w":[{"en":"And","sm":"Ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"e"},{"en":"·","sm":"mavae"},{"en":"when had passed away","sm":"atu"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"·","sm":"toluselau"},{"en":"the three hundred and eighty","sm":"valusefulu"},{"en":"·","sm":"ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"and fourth","sm":"fa"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"year,","sm":"tausaga"},{"en":"·","sm":"ua"},{"en":"·","sm":"matou"},{"en":"·","sm":"faapotopotoina"},{"en":"we had gathered together","sm":"faatasi"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"·","sm":"matou"},{"en":"·","sm":"tagata"},{"en":"all our people","sm":"uma"},{"en":"·","sm":"na"},{"en":"that remained","sm":"totoe"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"in the land","sm":"laueleele"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"of Cumorah.","sm":"Kumora."}]},{"en":"And it came to pass that when we had gathered in all our people in one to the land of Cumorah, behold I, Mormon, began to be old; and knowing it to be the last struggle of my people, and having been commanded of the Lord that I should not suffer the records which had been handed down by our fathers, which were sacred, to fall into the hands of the Lamanites, (for the Lamanites would destroy them) therefore I made this record out of the plates of Nephi, and hid up in the hill Cumorah all the records which had been entrusted to me by the hand of the Lord, save it were these few plates which I gave unto my son Moroni.","n":6,"sm":"Ma sa oo ina ua uma ona matou faapotopoto faatasi o matou tagata uma i le laueleele o Kumora, faauta, o a’u, o Mamona, sa amata ona ou toeaina; ma i lo’u iloa o le tauiviga faaiu lea a lo’u nuu, ma ina ua poloaiina a’u e le Alii ia ou le tuuina talafaamaumau ia na tuulima faasolo mai e o matou tamā, ina ia pa’u’ū atu i lima o sa Lamanā, (ona e faaumatia ai i latou e sa Lamanā) o lea na ou faia ai lenei talafaamaumau mai papatusi a Nifae, ma natia mau i le maupu’epu’e o Kumora ia talafaamaumau uma na tuuina mai ia te au e le aao o le Alii, vagana ai nai papatusi itiiti nei na ou tuuina atu i lo’u atalii o Moronae.","w":[{"en":"·","sm":"Ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"sa"},{"en":"·","sm":"oo"},{"en":"And it came to pass that","sm":"ina"},{"en":"·","sm":"ua"},{"en":"·","sm":"uma"},{"en":"after","sm":"ona"},{"en":"·","sm":"matou"},{"en":"·","sm":"faapotopoto"},{"en":"we had gathered together","sm":"faatasi"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"·","sm":"matou"},{"en":"·","sm":"tagata"},{"en":"all our people","sm":"uma"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"in the land","sm":"laueleele"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"of Cumorah,","sm":"Kumora,"},{"en":"behold,","sm":"faauta,"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"I,","sm":"a’u,"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"Mormon,","sm":"Mamona,"},{"en":"·","sm":"sa"},{"en":"·","sm":"amata"},{"en":"·","sm":"ona"},{"en":"·","sm":"ou"},{"en":"began to grow old;","sm":"toeaina;"},{"en":"and","sm":"ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"·","sm":"lo’u"},{"en":"seeing","sm":"iloa"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"·","sm":"tauiviga"},{"en":"·","sm":"faaiu"},{"en":"this last struggle","sm":"lea"},{"en":"·","sm":"a"},{"en":"·","sm":"lo’u"},{"en":"of my people,","sm":"nuu,"},{"en":"and","sm":"ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"ina"},{"en":"·","sm":"ua"},{"en":"when had been commanded","sm":"poloaiina"},{"en":"me","sm":"a’u"},{"en":"·","sm":"e"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"by the Lord","sm":"Alii"},{"en":"·","sm":"ia"},{"en":"·","sm":"ou"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"that I should not give up","sm":"tuuina"},{"en":"the records","sm":"talafaamaumau"},{"en":"·","sm":"ia"},{"en":"·","sm":"na"},{"en":"·","sm":"tuulima"},{"en":"·","sm":"faasolo"},{"en":"which had been handed